{
  "description": "«≈ conversion» pure rules (Android CurrencyConversion.kt / iOS CurrencyConversion in CurrencyConverter.swift). classify with the fiat list «fiat» (currencies with an fx rate). quoteToUsd: USD exactly 1; USDT = live USDT/USD if 0.05..3.0 (PortfolioStables.usdtUsdLive), else 1, null = 1; other stablecoins market rate in USDT x that factor, none without a valid rate; FIAT 1/usdToQuote; CRYPTO cryptoUsdt x factor; FIAT_UNSUPPORTED/INVALID none. chain: rate = quoteToUsd x usdToTarget (both > 0 and finite, result finite), converted = amount x rate (no rounding in the rule; display formats later). freshQuotePrice: crypto/stable quote at most 15 min old (boundary inclusive). staleFxTime: oldest fx time if older than 3 h (boundary exclusive). Numbers compared with relative tolerance 1e-12. classify: every UTF-16 unit must be a Unicode letter (Lu/Ll/Lt/Lm/Lo) or decimal digit (Nd) like Kotlin Char.isLetterOrDigit (other number signs like ½ or Ⅷ and characters outside the BMP are invalid), length in UTF-16 units at most 15.",
